<title>USA: Citizens to buy American Investment.</title>
<headline>Citizens to buy American Investment.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens Inc said Wednesday that a subsidiary has a definitive agreement to acquire American Investment Network Inc for an exchange of stock.</p>
<p>Under the deal, which involves its wholly owned subsidiary, Citizens Insurance Co of America, it will acquire all of American's outstanding shares for shares of Citizens' Class A common stock.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Citizens Insurance will issue one share of Citizens Class A common stock it owns for each 7.2 shares of American issued and outstanding.</p>
</text>
